Program with 1, 2, 3, or 4 messages at a time, with each message button measuring at 2.75 cm x 2.75 cm. Powerful, high-quality speaker allows for remarkable volume from a small device.

Manufacturer: Attainment Company (https://www.attainmentcompany.com/)

GoTalk Go Support: https://www.attainmentcompany.com/mwdownloads/download/link/id/1503

