Teach coding, robotics, AR, VR, and the Internet of Things (IoT) in one easy-to-use web platform that works seamlessly on just about any device. Students code their robots to navigate the mat in real life, in real-time, wherever they are in the world.  At the same time, their 3D Robot avatars collaborate in a virtual world.

Kai’s Clan User Guide: https://kaisclan.ai/support/

','cognition','Kai’s Clan','','','https://at.mada.org.qa/technology/kais-clan/','https://at.mada.org.qa/technology/kais-clan/','https://cdn.at.mada.org.qa/data/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/kais-clan.png','[]','','','published',1,0,'vi',NULL,'2026-10-16T11:53:58.610Z','2026-10-23T08:13:48.724Z','Kai’s Clan is a collaborative coding platform that encompasses several technologies into an all-in-one learning platform.

Teach coding, robotics, AR, VR, and the Internet of Things (IoT) in one easy-to-use web platform that works seamlessly on just about any device. Students code their robots to navigate the mat in real life, in real-time, wherever they are in the world.  At the same time, their 3D Robot avatars collaborate in a virtual world.

