 color on the screen. Additional Information: Manufacture: Zoomax (https://www.zoomax.com/low-vision-products/24-inch-foldable-desktop-video-magnifier-aurora-hd.html) User Guide: https://www.zoomax.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Aurora-HD-Brochure.pdf','vision','','','','https://at.mada.org.qa/technology/aurora-hd/','https://at.mada.org.qa/technology/aurora-hd/','https://cdn.at.mada.org.qa/data/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Aurora-HD.png','[]','','','published',0,0,'vi',NULL,'2026-10-19T14:27:52.108Z','2026-10-22T07:16:51.269Z',NULL,NULL,NULL);
